  "description": "Americano: The Gold Standard in Touring Bikes\nSet out on epic self-supported adventures with the Americano, the ultimate touring bike built to handle the toughest journeys without compromise. Engineered for durability, comfort, and reliability, this bike is your trusted companion for touring anywhere in the world.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c Wheels: Compatible with 28mm–38mm tires for smooth performance and stability across long distances and varied terrain.\n\nReynolds 725 Tubing: Exclusive, reliable, and tough steel construction ensures unparalleled strength and ride quality.\n\nSteel Uni-Crown Touring Fork: Designed for precise handling and load stability, no matter the weight of your gear.\n\nCo-Motion Touring Geometry: Proven geometry that balances comfort and efficiency for extended rides.\n\nRack, Fender, and Bottle Mounts: Equipped to carry everything you need, with three bottle mounts for hydration on the go.\n\nMechanical Disc Brakes and Hand-Built Touring Wheels: Dependable stopping power and durable wheels built for the demands of touring.\n\nCustomizable Drivetrain Options:\n\nShimano 2x11-speed drivetrain for versatility and range\nRohloff 14-speed internal hub for simplicity and reliability\nPinion gearbox for low-maintenance, the widest range of gearing, and rugged performance\n\nThe Americano redefines what a touring bike can be, offering unmatched durability, adaptability, and comfort for world travelers and weekend explorers alike. Wherever your journey takes you, this bike is ready to go the distance.\nAlso note: If you are a larger/heavier rider, this is the perfect option. We are happy to work with you and build you a custom-built bike that fits your needs when no bike shop in the world can help you with an \"off the shelf\" bike.\n\nClick here to\nget your Co-Motion Americano order started!",
